L57: Figure 4 The chemical structure of α-tocopherol phosphate (αTP).
L58: Figure 5 A summary of the potential molecular mechanisms of vitamin E (α-tocopherol) in vascular disease prevention via the suppression and upregulation of genes and metabolic pathways. Solid arrows: primary effect; dotted arrows: secondary effect (intermediate steps are not shown); double arrows: interactions.
